{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a3ce0eb35f9176382260d30d0f25dc139f193a7e6e65d0e12dc07a11030bd42e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["羔羊与封印的书卷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["接着，我看见坐在宝座上的那位右手拿着一卷内外写着字、用七个印封住的书。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我又看见一位大能天使高声问道：“谁有资格揭开那七个封印，打开书卷？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["可是，天上、地上、甚至地底下谁都没有资格开卷阅读。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我见谁都没有资格开卷阅读，便放声大哭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["有一位长老对我说：“不要哭！看啊，犹大支派的狮子，大卫的根已经得胜了，祂能揭开那七个封印，打开书卷。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我又看到宝座、四个活物和众长老之间站着一只好像是被宰杀过的羔羊。祂有七只角和七只眼睛，这些是指被派往普天下的上帝的七灵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["羔羊走上前去，从坐在宝座上的那位右手中接过书卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["祂拿过书卷后，四个活物和二十四位长老就各拿着竖琴和盛满了香的金香炉，俯伏在羔羊面前。那些香就是众圣徒的祈祷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他们唱着一首新歌：",{"text":"“你配拿书卷并揭开封印，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你曾被杀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你的血从各部落、各语言族群、各民族、各国家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将人买赎回来归给上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你又使他们成为上帝的国度和祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要在地上执掌王权。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我又看见宝座、四个活物和众长老的周围有千千万万的天使，并听见他们高声呼喊："]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["“曾被杀的羔羊配得权柄、财富、智慧、能力、尊贵、荣耀和颂赞！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我又听到天上、地上、地底下和海洋中一切被造之物同声说：“愿颂赞、尊贵、荣耀和权柄都归给坐在宝座上的那位和羔羊，直到永永远远！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["四个活物就说：“阿们！”众长老也俯伏敬拜。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}